sequenceDiagram
    participant CLIENT as Seller/API Gateway
    participant BIZ_REG as Business Registry Service
    participant USER as User Service
    participant COMPLIANCE as Compliance Service
    participant NOTIFICATION as Notification Service
    participant ANALYTICS as Analytics Service
    participant KAFKA as Kafka Event Bus

    Note over CLIENT,ANALYTICS: Business Registration Saga

    CLIENT->>BIZ_REG: POST /businesses (register business)
    activate BIZ_REG
    BIZ_REG->>BIZ_REG: Validate business data
    BIZ_REG->>BIZ_REG: Create business (PENDING)
    BIZ_REG->>KAFKA: Publish BusinessRegistered event
    BIZ_REG-->>CLIENT: 201 Created (businessId)
    deactivate BIZ_REG

    Note over BIZ_REG,KAFKA: Saga Step 1: User Account Creation

    KAFKA->>USER: BusinessRegistered event
    activate USER
    USER->>USER: Create seller user account
    USER->>USER: Assign SELLER role
    USER->>KAFKA: Publish UserCreated event
    deactivate USER

    Note over BIZ_REG,KAFKA: Saga Step 2: Compliance Check

    KAFKA->>COMPLIANCE: BusinessRegistered event
    activate COMPLIANCE
    COMPLIANCE->>COMPLIANCE: Create compliance record
    COMPLIANCE->>COMPLIANCE: Initiate KYC verification
    COMPLIANCE->>COMPLIANCE: Check business documents
    alt KYC Documents Valid
        COMPLIANCE->>COMPLIANCE: Update compliance status (VERIFIED)
        COMPLIANCE->>KAFKA: Publish KYCCompleted event
    else KYC Documents Invalid
        COMPLIANCE->>COMPLIANCE: Update compliance status (REJECTED)
        COMPLIANCE->>KAFKA: Publish KYCRejected event
    end
    deactivate COMPLIANCE

    Note over BIZ_REG,KAFKA: Saga Step 3: Business Verification

    KAFKA->>BIZ_REG: KYCCompleted event
    activate BIZ_REG
    BIZ_REG->>BIZ_REG: Update business status (VERIFIED)
    BIZ_REG->>KAFKA: Publish BusinessVerified event
    deactivate BIZ_REG

    Note over BIZ_REG,KAFKA: Saga Step 4: Notifications

    KAFKA->>NOTIFICATION: BusinessRegistered event
    activate NOTIFICATION
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Send verification email
    NOTIFICATION->>KAFKA: Publish EmailSent event
    deactivate NOTIFICATION

    KAFKA->>NOTIFICATION: BusinessVerified event
    activate NOTIFICATION
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Send welcome email
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Send onboarding guide
    NOTIFICATION->>KAFKA: Publish EmailSent event
    deactivate NOTIFICATION

    Note over BIZ_REG,KAFKA: Analytics & Tracking

    KAFKA->>ANALYTICS: BusinessRegistered, BusinessVerified
    activate ANALYTICS
    ANALYTICS->>ANALYTICS: Track seller onboarding
    ANALYTICS->>ANALYTICS: Update seller metrics
    deactivate ANALYTICS

    Note over CLIENT,ANALYTICS: Compensation Flow - KYC Rejection

    KAFKA->>BIZ_REG: KYCRejected event
    activate BIZ_REG
    BIZ_REG->>BIZ_REG: Update business status (REJECTED)
    BIZ_REG->>KAFKA: Publish BusinessRejected event
    deactivate BIZ_REG

    KAFKA->>NOTIFICATION: BusinessRejected event
    activate NOTIFICATION
    NOTIFICATION->>NOTIFICATION: Send rejection email with reasons
    NOTIFICATION->>KAFKA: Publish EmailSent event
    deactivate NOTIFICATION

    KAFKA->>USER: BusinessRejected event
    activate USER
    USER->>USER: Disable seller account
    USER->>KAFKA: Publish UserDisabled event
    deactivate USER
